<mxfile host="Electron">
  <diagram id="_f3egRJjRtHBMQy_nuCT" name="Page-1">
    <mxGraphModel dx="4778" dy="2504" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\nconfig:\n  theme: neutral\n  themeVariables:\n    fontFamily: Arial\n    fontSize: 15px\n    lineColor: \&quot;#000000\&quot;\n    edgeLabelBackground: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;\n  flowchart:\n    curve: basis\n    nodeSpacing: 42\n    rankSpacing: 135\n    htmlLabels: true\n---\n\n%% Figure: Perform Virtual Experiment Use Case Diagram\n%% Beaker Breakers Studio\n%% Scope: experiment selection, step execution, AI guidance, knowledge quiz, AR mode\n%% Source: Chapter 3 requirements FR-03.1 to FR-03.8, FR-04.1 to FR-04.5,\n%%         FR-05.1 to FR-05.6, FR-06.1, FR-06.2, FR-02.3, NFR-05, NFR-06\n%%         SRS Section 20, UC-03 Perform Virtual Experiment\n\n%% Shape note: Mermaid has no ellipse shape. Use cases are drawn here with the\n%% stadium shape ([text]), which is the nearest oval Mermaid offers. The\n%% Graphviz version of this figure uses true UML ellipses and is the one to\n%% place in the report.\n\nflowchart LR\n\n    %% ================= Actors =================\n    Student[\&quot;Student\&quot;]\n    Gemini[\&quot;Gemini API&lt;br/&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;external&amp;gt;&amp;gt;\&quot;]\n\n    %% ================= System boundary =================\n    subgraph SYS[\&quot;Beaker Breakers Studio (Virtual Experiment Scope)\&quot;]\n\n        UC03([\&quot;UC-03&lt;br/&gt;Perform Virtual Experiment\&quot;])\n        UC08([\&quot;UC-08&lt;br/&gt;Browse Experiment Library\&quot;])\n        FILTER([\&quot;Filter Library by&lt;br/&gt;Difficulty and Topic\&quot;])\n        UC02([\&quot;UC-02&lt;br/&gt;Safety Certification\&quot;])\n        PREREQ([\&quot;Verify Prerequisite Experiment\&quot;])\n        STEPS([\&quot;Present Steps in Declared Order\&quot;])\n        RECORD([\&quot;Record Step Completion\&quot;])\n        EQN([\&quot;Display Chemical Equation&lt;br/&gt;and Explanatory Note\&quot;])\n        RESUME([\&quot;Resume Incomplete Experiment\&quot;])\n        REPEAT([\&quot;Repeat Completed Experiment\&quot;])\n\n        UC25([\&quot;UC-25&lt;br/&gt;Receive AI Step Guidance\&quot;])\n        PREAUTH([\&quot;Present Pre Authored Guidance\&quot;])\n\n        UC09([\&quot;UC-09&lt;br/&gt;Take Knowledge Quiz\&quot;])\n        FEEDBK([\&quot;Show Answer Feedback&lt;br/&gt;and Explanation\&quot;])\n        RECQ([\&quot;Record Quiz Attempt\&quot;])\n        UC10([\&quot;UC-10&lt;br/&gt;Award Experience Points\&quot;])\n        REQUIZ([\&quot;Reattempt Failed Quiz\&quot;])\n\n        UC04([\&quot;UC-04&lt;br/&gt;AR Mode Session\&quot;])\n        CAM([\&quot;Request Camera Permission\&quot;])\n        SURF([\&quot;Detect and Anchor to Surface\&quot;])\n        SIM([\&quot;Present Simulated Mode\&quot;])\n        REL([\&quot;Release Camera and&lt;br/&gt;Motion Sensors\&quot;])\n    end\n\n    %% ================= Actor associations =================\n    %% UC-04, UC-09 and UC-25 carry no direct actor association: an included or\n    %% extending use case is never initiated by the actor on its own. The\n    %% student reaches them through UC-03.\n    Student --- UC03\n    Student --- UC08\n    UC25 --- Gemini\n\n    %% ================= Include relationships =================\n    UC08 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-03.2\&quot;| FILTER\n\n    UC03 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-02.3&lt;br/&gt;Tier 1 gate\&quot;| UC02\n    UC03 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-03.3\&quot;| PREREQ\n    UC03 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-03.4\&quot;| STEPS\n    UC03 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-03.5\&quot;| RECORD\n    UC03 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-03.6\&quot;| EQN\n    UC03 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-03.7\&quot;| UC25\n    UC03 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-04.1\&quot;| UC09\n\n    UC09 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-04.2\&quot;| FEEDBK\n    UC09 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-04.4\&quot;| RECQ\n    UC09 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-04.3\&quot;| UC10\n\n    UC04 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-05.2\&quot;| CAM\n    UC04 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-05.3\&quot;| SURF\n    UC04 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-05.6\&quot;| REL\n\n    %% ================= Extend relationships =================\n    PREAUTH -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt; NFR-06&lt;br/&gt;[AI service unavailable]\&quot;| UC25\n    REQUIZ -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-04.5&lt;br/&gt;[quiz not passed]\&quot;| UC09\n    SIM -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-05.4&lt;br/&gt;[device unsupported, permission&lt;br/&gt;refused or no surface found]\&quot;| UC04\n    UC04 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-05.1&lt;br/&gt;[AR available for experiment]\&quot;| UC03\n    RESUME -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-03.5&lt;br/&gt;[experiment incomplete]\&quot;| UC03\n    REPEAT -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-03.8&lt;br/&gt;[experiment already complete]\&quot;| UC03\n\n    %% ================= Constraint notes =================\n    %% NFR-05: no recorded progress, experience point or badge is lost on a page\n    %%         refresh, a session expiry or a network interruption.\n    %% FR-06.2: experience points are never awarded for the speed at which a\n    %%          step or a quiz is completed.\n    %% FR-03.1: the library holds no fewer than 30 experiments.\n    %% FR-05.1: augmented reality presentation is provided for no fewer than 4\n    %%          experiments, which is why UC-04 extends rather than includes.\n\n    %% ================= Styling (outline only, no fill colour) =================\n    classDef actor fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000000\n    classDef ext fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:5 4,color:#000000\n    classDef uc fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000000\n\n    class Student actor\n    class Gemini ext\n    class UC03,UC08,FILTER,UC02,PREREQ,STEPS,RECORD,EQN,RESUME,REPEAT uc\n    class UC25,PREAUTH,UC09,FEEDBK,RECQ,UC10,REQUIZ uc\n    class UC04,CAM,SURF,SIM,REL uc\n\n    style SYS fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000000\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="50">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
